        <translations>
          <translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans">
            <text for="L3">挣脱吧 挣脱吧 每个细胞都是</text>
            <text for="L4">我不需要 不情愿地哀叹现状</text>
            <text for="L5">这副姿态模样 很可笑对吧？</text>
            <text for="L6">难道你不觉得？</text>
            <text for="L7">我懒到了家 大概就这样</text>
            <text for="L8">美妙音符 不过是他人的排列</text>
            <text for="L9">丢弃 粉碎 通通扔掉</text>
            <text for="L10">难道你不觉得？</text>
            <text for="L11">在这世上 在这脑海之中</text>
            <text for="L12">多么美丽 漫天飘舞的花瓣</text>
            <text for="L13">巴拉莱卡酒 真想喝一杯</text>
            <text for="L16">谁人都大抵</text>
            <text for="L18">疯·狂·至·极</text>
            <text for="L20">任由那一瞬间的感情</text>
            <text for="L21">疾驰不停</text>
            <text for="L23">心跳至九五</text>
            <text for="L25">狂气的武士</text>
            <text for="L27">以血红的眼引人侧目 随时赴死</text>
            <text for="L28">哈喽 太阳升起</text>
            <text for="L29">你的天空 漆黑如墨的天空</text>
            <text for="L30">狂暴地将它撕裂</text>
            <text for="L31">看啊 就在那个地方</text>
            <text for="L32">传来心跳律动的机关</text>
            <text for="L33">轰鸣奏响的是自己的旋律</text>
            <text for="L34">不属于任何人 是自己的旋律</text>
            <text for="L36">眼前无限展开的世界 一片蔚蓝</text>
            <text for="L37">总而言之</text>
            <text for="L38">来吧 行动起来</text>
            <text for="L39">谈论什么活法 毫无必要</text>
            <text for="L40">何必那样干劲十足 趾高气昂</text>
            <text for="L41">再多给我些 爱</text>
            <text for="L42">左右都分不清</text>
            <text for="L43">一无所知就别妄言</text>
            <text for="L44">难道你不觉得？</text>
            <text for="L45">咧嘴一笑 暗影在笑</text>
            <text for="L47">世界这东西 大抵</text>
            <text for="L49">疯·狂·至·极</text>
            <text for="L51">仿佛循环往复</text>
            <text for="L52">疾驰不停</text>
            <text for="L54">明明什么都不懂</text>
            <text for="L56">却对这个那个 指手画脚</text>
            <text for="L58">告诉我吧 为那崭新伟大期待时代的圣经</text>
            <text for="L59">狠狠回击</text>
            <text for="L60">迷失心智 击中我自身</text>
            <text for="L61">握紧它 属于你的那个瞬间</text>
            <text for="L62">或许根本没错</text>
            <text for="L65">谁人都大抵</text>
            <text for="L67">疯·狂·至·极</text>
            <text for="L69">任由那一瞬间的感情</text>
            <text for="L70">疾驰不停</text>
            <text for="L72">心跳至九五</text>
            <text for="L74">狂气的武士</text>
            <text for="L76">以血红的眼引人侧目 随时赴死</text>
            <text for="L77">哈喽 太阳升起</text>
            <text for="L78">你的天空 漆黑如墨的天空</text>
            <text for="L79">狂暴地将它撕裂</text>
            <text for="L80">看啊 就在那个地方</text>
            <text for="L81">传来心跳律动的机关</text>
            <text for="L82">令人震惊的 还在后头</text>
            <text for="L83">才刚要开始</text>
            <text for="L84">早已等得迫不及待</text>
            <text for="L85">时钟的指针 零时的街道</text>
            <text for="L86">勇猛无畏 来吧 放声高喊</text>
            <text for="L87">看啊 就在不远处</text>
            <text for="L88">即将开启 孤高的盛宴</text>
            <text for="L89">奏响的是自己的旋律</text>
            <text for="L90">独一无二 属于自己的旋律</text>
          </translation>
          <translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en">
            <text for="L3">Break away, break away at the cellular level</text>
            <text for="L4">I don&apos;t need to grieve our current unwilling state</text>
            <text for="L5">That style and manner is ridiculous, right?</text>
            <text for="L7">I&apos;m so lazy, that&apos;s probably the case</text>
            <text for="L8">Just someone arranging a fine sound</text>
            <text for="L11">In this world, in this head of mine</text>
            <text for="L12">What a beautiful petal that falls</text>
            <text for="L13">Balalaika I want to quench my thirst</text>
            <text for="L16">Generally speaking, everyone&apos;s</text>
            <text for="L20">So let this fleeting emotion</text>
            <text for="L23">My heart is beating 95</text>
            <text for="L25">Like a mad samurai</text>
            <text for="L27">I&apos;m so ready to die that it&apos;s like it&apos;s attracting my bloodshot gaze</text>
            <text for="L28">Say hello as the sun rises</text>
            <text for="L29">On your sky, that pitch black sky</text>
            <text for="L30">I&apos;ll rip it apart with my bare hands</text>
            <text for="L31">You see, in that place</text>
            <text for="L32">There&apos;s the trick of an audible heartbeat</text>
            <text for="L33">What roars out is my own tune</text>
            <text for="L34">My own tune - not someone else&apos;s</text>
            <text for="L36">The world is blue, it stretches out before your eyes</text>
            <text for="L37">But for now</text>
            <text for="L38">Let&apos;s move move</text>
            <text for="L39">There&apos;s no need to speak about our way of living</text>
            <text for="L40">What&apos;s got you, exhilarated, so smug?</text>
            <text for="L41">Give me more love</text>
            <text for="L42">Left from right</text>
            <text for="L43">Don&apos;t say that you don&apos;t even know</text>
            <text for="L45">Your sneering shadow cackles</text>
            <text for="L47">Generally speaking, the world is</text>
            <text for="L51">So as if doing it over and over</text>
            <text for="L52">ride on, ride on, ride on, ride on</text>
            <text for="L54">I don&apos;t even understand it</text>
            <text for="L56">I authorize this and that</text>
            <text for="L58">Tell me something for the news, the bible for an era of great expectation</text>
            <text for="L61">Save it for your big moment</text>
            <text for="L65">Generally speaking, everyone&apos;s</text>
            <text for="L69">So let this fleeting emotion</text>
            <text for="L70">Ride on, ride on, ride on, ride on</text>
            <text for="L72">My heart is beating 95</text>
            <text for="L74">Like a mad samurai</text>
            <text for="L76">I&apos;m so ready to die that it&apos;s like it&apos;s attracting my bloodshot gaze</text>
            <text for="L77">Say hello as the sun rises</text>
            <text for="L78">On your sky, that pitch black sky</text>
            <text for="L79">I&apos;ll rip it apart with my bare hands</text>
            <text for="L80">You see, in that place</text>
            <text for="L81">There&apos;s the trick of an audible heartbeat</text>
            <text for="L82">More surprises are yet to come</text>
            <text for="L83">Yet to come</text>
            <text for="L84">Ah, I&apos;m sick of waiting around</text>
            <text for="L85">The clock hand ushers the midnight city</text>
            <text for="L86">Come on, fiercely raise your voice</text>
            <text for="L87">Hey, it&apos;s almost time</text>
            <text for="L88">So let&apos;s begin this solitary feast</text>
            <text for="L89">The song I play is my own tune:</text>
            <text for="L90">My one of a kind tune</text>
